		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### Stage 3 — Chaos (3)\nDocker stop/restart\nCHAOS-001..003\ndb down, backend down,\nrestart recovery\nDOCKER_CHAOS=1 guard","x":440,"y":-240,"width":240,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### Shared Patterns\npage.route() → route.fulfill({json})\n(no response param — gzip fix)\ntid() truncates UUID to 12 hex\nAuth from localStorage\ntoken via page.evaluate()\nDB restore in afterEach\nChaos guard: DOCKER_CHAOS=1","x":-240,"y":340,"width":340,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### Bugs Found\n\n**BUG-005 (Critical):** Post content renders raw HTML — XSS\n**BUG-006 (Low):** Negative likes_count displayed as -5\n\nFound by DB mutation stage","x":280,"y":400,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"1"},
